\begin_layout Standard
The gym-environment has a leaderboard containing the approaches that have
 been able to learn the fastest to create a policy that solves the problem
 in steps of less than 
\begin_inset Formula $110$
\end_inset

.
\begin_inset Foot
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset CommandInset href
LatexCommand href
name "https://github.com/openai/gym/wiki/Leaderboard"
target "https://github.com/openai/gym/wiki/Leaderboard"

\end_inset


\end_layout

\end_inset

 The best RL approach at that time was chosen as a black box, which uses
 a SARSA approach paired with tiling to achieve the target of less than
 110 steps in 75 episodes.
\begin_inset CommandInset citation
LatexCommand cite
key "xiao2019"

\end_inset

 
\begin_inset Note Comment
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Der zum damaligen Zeitpunkt beste RL-Ansatz wurde als Blackbox gewählt,
 welcher einen SARSA Ansatz, gepaart mit Tiling, nutzt um in 75 Episoden
 das Ziel von unter 110 Schritten erreicht.
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

